---
manual: events.release
lines: [2277, 2284]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
$events = []
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  stack width: 200, height: 100 do
    click { |button, left, top| $events << [:click, button, left, top] }
    release { |button, left, top| $events << [:release, button, left, top] }
  end
end
----------- test code
click_at 70, 30
assert_equal [[:click, 1, 70, 30], [:release, 1, 70, 30]], $events,
  "release runs once, after the press, with the button and where it was let go"
